# Excalidraw Data

## Text Elements
No infrastructure redundacy required ^93zffFcj

This is the default option. It is simply a standalone  server
Azure places your virtual machine on a random physical server. ^e7Qu9cDy

It separates your machines into different buildings, 
within the same city or region ^BMV3dx5K

Avaliability Zone ^BJ51zYLA

SLA 99.99% ^7FqKaxNR

Availability Set ^X5gVSlx6

SLA 99.95% ^BynAG2aF

It keeps your machines inside the same building, but Azure 
guarantees they are placed in different physical racks. ^VijoS9ax

Virtual Machine Scale Sets ^IAZLlvmd

Instead of manually creating machines, you create a "template" or base image.
 The system automatically creates or destroys identical clones of that machine
 based on demand. ^Im3Uwil8

